==German==

===Etymology===
A diminutive form pertaining to {{term|Knoblauch|lang=de}}. The ''-f-'' is due to its being derived from dialectal forms. One would expect a {{etym|nds-de|de}} origin (cf. {{etym|gml|-}} {{term|knoflōk|lang=gml}}), but there are also forms with ''-f-'' in some southern German dialects (themselves from a {{etym|goh|-}} variant {{term|chlovalouh|lang=goh}}).

